ear 1- Year 5) using Devanagari script. What is Wana Bantawa? Wana Bantawa (also called simply Bantawa), spoken by the Bantawa subcaste. The Amchoke dialect is spoken in the Limbu area, especially in Ilam district. Bantawa is also considered as a superior clan in the Kiranti family.",Bantawa,Sino-Tibetan
